{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Harmony Preference in Games.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Harmony Preference in Games.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"harmony preference in games harmony preference in games","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Harmony Preference in Games.md","fileName":"Harmony Preference in Games.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Harmony Preference in Games","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-18 16:43\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Player Preference and Audience]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Player Preference and Audience","fundamentalsofgamedesign3e.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Harmony Preference in Games.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Harmony Preference in Games.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"harmony preference in games harmony preference in games","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Harmony Preference in Games.md","fileName":"Harmony Preference in Games.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Harmony Preference in Games","heading":"Harmony Preference in Games","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Harmony preference is the desire for cooperative, agreeable, and socially supportive play. It is associated with agreeableness in the source's model and contrasts with attraction to direct interpersonal conflict.\n\nA harmony-oriented design can reward assistance and shared success without eliminating meaningful tension. Competitive games should not assume that every socially motivated player wants adversarial interaction.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Player Preference and Audience","fundamentalsofgamedesign3e.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Harmony Preference in Games.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Harmony Preference in Games.md","sourceType":"markdown","se